Backlight fade on lock and wake, and a brightness log (with sweetpanel=1).

Display off ramps DCS 0x51 from the current level to 1 in 16 steps (~260 ms,
squared curve) before the black frame and sleep-in; display on ramps from 1
back to the kept level. The first 12 IOMFBBrightnessLevel requests are
logged so a boot shows whether the slider reaches the panel.

--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp
